@startuml
title Bounded Context Map

left to right direction

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component Catalog
component Ordering
component Inventory
component Payment
component Shipping
component Identity
component Profile
component Location

Catalog --> Ordering : Published Language
Catalog --> Inventory : Published Language
Inventory --> Ordering : Published Language

Ordering --> Payment : Published Language
Ordering --> Shipping : Published Language

Identity --> Ordering : Conformist
Identity --> Profile : Shared Identity

Location --> Profile : Reference Data
Location --> Shipping : Reference Data
Location --> Ordering : Reference Data

note bottom
All communication uses MediatR ISender.
Contexts share Result<T> as Shared Kernel.
end note

@enduml